      "url": "https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/orcl/transcripts/780561-investor-day-2026/",
      "core": false,
      "briefed": true,
      "brief_file": "summary-orcl-investor-day-2026.md",
      "tldr": [
        "Oracle positions AI as an accelerator across its integrated stack—OCI, databases, and applications—with revenue targeted above $225 billion in FY2030, a stated 35% CAGR.",
        "Infrastructure execution and contracted demand underpin the plan: $664 billion of RPO, more than 90% tied to infrastructure, and approximately 7 GW of incremental capacity planned to bring the portfolio to roughly 10 GW by the end of FY2028.",
        "The investment cycle will pressure near-term margins and liquidity: Oracle expects CapEx to peak in FY2027–FY2028, free cash flow to turn positive during the second half of FY2028, and more than $30 billion of free cash flow in FY2029."
      ],
      "on_watchlist": true
    },
