      "tldr": [
        "Strategy reported record quarterly profitability, driven by a **$20.9 billion Bitcoin fair-value gain**: operating income was $20.9 billion, net income was $19.1 billion, and diluted EPS was $44.75. The company held **848,517 Bitcoin** as of the call.",
        "The balance sheet strengthened materially: net leverage fell to **2.4% from 8.4%**, net Bitcoin coverage reached **4.6x**, and USD assets covered approximately **3.4 years** of interest and dividend obligations.",
        "Management is positioning digital credit as its principal capital-raising and Bitcoin-acquisition channel. Stretch returned near par after buybacks, daily dividends were approved, and management says it believes it has capacity to create substantial additional digital credit without raising more equity."
      ],
